                "description": "Filter by consequence"
              },
              {
                "name": "scheduleable_type",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by the scheduleable type of the schedule. Either both or none of `scheduleable_id` and `scheduleable_type` are required."
              },
              {
                "name": "scheduleable_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by the scheduleable id of the schedule. Either both or none of `scheduleable_id` and `scheduleable_type` are required."
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The schedule resource represents a simplified calendar event or event generation rule, and may be used to configure time based functionality:\n\n- When access is allowed or restricted (\"time restrictions\"), set `consequence` to `allow`\n- When elevator stops are kept accessible (\"permit timer\"), set `consequence` to `permit`\n- When locks are kept unlocked (\"unlock timer\"), set `consequence` to `unlock`\n- To override an allow, permit or unlock, set `override` to `true`. The schedule will then neutra"
